<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114672" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρησμός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χράω</span> (B) A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>oracular response, oracle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1044.49
			</span></i> (Halic., <span class="entity">iv/iii B. C.</span>), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἀσήμους δυσκρίτως τ᾽ εἰρημένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					662
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχρησ᾽ Ἀδράστῳ Αοξίας χρησμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					409
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφι χρησμὸν ἔφαινε</span>
			delivered <i>an oracle</i> to them, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.159
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾄδειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.21
				</span></i>
			 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρησμῳδός</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; εὔτεκνοι χ.</span> promising happy progeny,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				424
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἔμμετρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.396c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλογάδην τοὺς χ.
			λέγειν</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				397d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρησμὸς . . περαίνεται</span> is
			fulfilled, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1703
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρησμοῦ ὄντος . . τὴν πόλιν
					διαφθαρῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					415c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ χρησμοὺς
			γράψαντες,</span> i. e. with all solemnity, <i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				92
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.171
			</span></i>.</div>
